  "body": "Experience the pinnacle of coastal living on Takapuna's renowned Golden Mile. Set on a 604sqm (approx) freehold title with mesmerizing Lake Pupuke views, this beautifully renovated (2015) Hamptons inspired weatherboard home blends timeless style with modern comfort. Offering four spacious bedrooms, two stylish bathrooms, and two generous living areas, it also features an internal lift for effortless, future proof living and double internal access garaging plus plenty of off street parking.\r\n\r\nInside, oak timber flooring, vaulted ceilings, LED lighting, central heating, a gas fireplace, and full double glazing ensure year-round comfort. The showpiece entertainer's kitchen, with premium appliances and abundant bench space, flows seamlessly to the open plan living and dining zones, perfect for hosting family and friends. Sun streams in all day, enhancing the welcoming atmosphere and framing panoramic lake views.\r\n\r\nThe location is unbeatable. Stroll to Lake Pupuke, Milford, and Takapuna beaches, and enjoy easy walks to Milford Village and Takapuna CBD's shops, cafes, and restaurants. Move in and immerse yourself in luxury, convenience, and location.\r\n\r\nEnquire now for viewing times and the full information pack.",
